business_integration_content = '''# 💼 OASIS v3 Business Integration Guide

## Overview

This guide covers integrating OASIS v3 with essential business platforms to create the complete automated business ecosystem as outlined in your roadmap:

- **Layer 2**: Development & Deployment (GitHub, Vercel, HF Spaces, Supabase)
- **Layer 3**: Monetization & Tracking (Stripe, Hotjar)
- **Layer 4**: Operations & Marketing (Zapier, Make.com)

## Layer 3: Monetization & Tracking

### Stripe Integration (Payment Gateway)

#### Setup Process

1. **Create Stripe Account**
   ```bash
   # Visit https://stripe.com and create account
   # Get API keys from dashboard
   ```

2. **Configure Products & Pricing**
   ```javascript
   // In Stripe Dashboard, create products:

   // Basic Plan - $29/month
   {
     name: "OASIS Basic",
     description: "AI Processing for individuals",
     pricing: "price_basic_monthly"
   }

   // Pro Plan - $99/month  
   {
     name: "OASIS Pro",
     description: "Advanced AI with analytics",
     pricing: "price_pro_monthly"
   }

   // Enterprise Plan - $299/month
   {
     name: "OASIS Enterprise", 
     description: "Unlimited AI with priority support",
     pricing: "price_enterprise_monthly"
   }
   ```

3. **Webhook Configuration**
   ```bash
   # Add webhook endpoint in Stripe Dashboard:
   # URL: https://your-domain.com/api/stripe/webhook
   # Events: customer.subscription.created, customer.subscription.updated, customer.subscription.deleted, invoice.payment_succeeded
   ```

4. **Environment Variables**
   ```env
   NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
   ```

#### Revenue Tracking Implementation

```typescript
// Revenue tracking function
export async function trackRevenue(
  userId: string,
  amount: number,
  source: 'subscription' | 'api_usage' | 'enterprise',
  metadata?: Record<string, any>
) {
  const { data, error } = await supabase
    .from('revenue_events')
    .insert({
      user_id: userId,
      amount: amount,
      source: source,
      metadata: metadata,
      created_at: new Date().toISOString()
    });

  // Also send to analytics
  if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.gtag) {
    window.gtag('event', 'purchase', {
      transaction_id: `rev_${Date.now()}`,
      value: amount,
      currency: 'USD',
      event_category: 'revenue',
      event_label: source
    });
  }
}
```

### Hotjar Integration (User Analytics)

#### Setup Process

1. **Create Hotjar Account**
   - Visit https://hotjar.com
   - Create new site for your domain
   - Get Hotjar ID from dashboard

2. **Installation**
   ```typescript
   // Add to src/app/layout.tsx
   export default function RootLayout({
     children,
   }: {
