```

### Automated Reporting

```typescript
// Weekly business report generation
export async function generateWeeklyReport() {
  const metrics = await calculateWeeklyMetrics();

  const report = {
    period: 'Weekly Report',
    revenue: {
      total: metrics.revenue,
      growth: metrics.revenueGrowth,
      projection: metrics.projectedMRR
    },
    users: {
      new: metrics.newUsers,
      churned: metrics.churnedUsers,
      active: metrics.activeUsers
    },
    product: {
      apiCalls: metrics.totalAPICalls,
      averageUsage: metrics.avgUsagePerUser,
      topFeatures: metrics.mostUsedFeatures
    },
    insights: await generateBusinessInsights(metrics)
  };

  // Send to team via email/Slack
  await sendReportToTeam(report);

  // Save to database for historical tracking
  await saveReport(report);

  return report;
}
```

## Integration Checklist

### Pre-Launch
- [ ] Stripe products and pricing configured
- [ ] Webhook endpoints tested and verified
- [ ] Hotjar tracking implemented and tested
- [ ] Zapier/Make.com scenarios created and active
- [ ] Email templates created and tested
- [ ] Analytics dashboards configured

### Post-Launch
- [ ] Monitor conversion rates daily
- [ ] Track customer lifecycle metrics
- [ ] Review automation performance weekly
- [ ] Optimize based on user behavior data
- [ ] Scale successful automation workflows
- [ ] A/B test different campaigns and flows

## Troubleshooting Common Issues

### Stripe Integration
- **Webhook failures**: Check endpoint URL and SSL certificate
- **Payment failures**: Verify API keys and test with Stripe CLI
- **Subscription sync issues**: Implement retry logic and logging

### Analytics Integration  
- **Missing events**: Check implementation and ad blockers
- **Data discrepancies**: Verify tracking codes and filters
- **Performance impact**: Implement lazy loading for analytics scripts

### Automation Failures
- **Zapier/Make.com errors**: Check API limits and authentication
- **Email delivery issues**: Verify sender reputation and SPF/DKIM
- **Timing problems**: Add delays and error handling to workflows

This integration setup creates a fully automated business ecosystem that can scale from startup to enterprise while maintaining high efficiency and customer satisfaction.
'''

